{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30156","headline":"郡中有怀寄上睦州员外杜十三兄 · 邢羣","name":"郡中有怀寄上睦州员外杜十三兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城枕溪流更浅斜，丽谯连带邑人家。\n经冬野菜青青色，未腊山梅处处花。\n虽免嶂云生岭上，永无音信到天涯。\n如今岁[晏]从羁滞，心喜弹冠事不赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邢羣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}